The country shapes in src/geo/countries.json.gz are Natural Earth's Admin 0 countries at 1:50m
(naturalearthdata.com), in the public domain, cut down to their codes, names and outlines.
The maps in src/geo/world.svg and src/geo/europe.svg are drawn from the same Natural Earth
countries, at 1:110m and 1:50m, with mapshaper.

